{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/d6b5f88ff7e10f6833e3d1e28853d4f1.poster.avif?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/d6b5f88ff7e10f6833e3d1e28853d4f1.webm?t=1773411130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Echoes of Mora brings the fantasy of diving into a mysterious underwater world to life. Swim through a flooded, abandoned village, find hidden objects, and uncover secrets in this cozy and atmospheric narrative adventure. Join young Mora in her quest to find her missing brother across the boundaries of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/e5dcb379babbe1139bc7383e346af33d.webp?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a3d4bdc39d840f65b69598946bd7bcd2.poster.avif?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a3d4bdc39d840f65b69598946bd7bcd2.webm?t=1773411130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues about the village's story, solve puzzles, and unlock Echoes to see the events before the flood. Inside these time portals, experience the village's beauty before the tragedy, hear villagers' conversations, and communicate with Mora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her brother disappears near a cursed violet lake, Mora sets out to find him. As the lake's water rises, threatening the village, your help is crucial. Share clues you find in the underwater world, guide Mora in the past, and accompany her on a\u00a0time-bending journey that could decide the flood's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/9a96fa971cc9d9e46041c4b6fa8670f9.webp?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ad453cec618019cba35477d92447def4.poster.avif?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ad453cec618019cba35477d92447def4.webm?t=1773411130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can smoothly navigate the sunken landscape and enjoy lots of intriguing interactions with the environment. Play on PC with keyboard, mouse, or controller - or opt for a breathtaking immersive VR experience with natural arm-based swimming via motion tracking. Switch seamlessly between modes anytime, giving you complete freedom to choose how you explore the underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a1260be45e54af48b249fa0b98bdb672.poster.avif?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a1260be45e54af48b249fa0b98bdb672.webm?t=1773411130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/89027832da2c65c85f14302c70ffb151.webp?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a captivating underwater world with an emotional story about a sibling duo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, unlock Echoes to travel back in time &amp; collect hidden clues to unravel the story behind Mora's missing brother</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with Mora in the past to shape the fate of the village &amp; influence the course of the flood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on PC with keyboard/mouse or controller; experience full immersion with VR support for compatible headsets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch seamlessly between PC &amp; VR modes at any time during the same play session</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129050?t=1773411130","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3129050?t=1773411130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/58b1b967c86fb2a3f47e005dc60e245b6d40ab74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773411130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/58b1b967c86fb2a3f47e005dc60e245b6d40ab74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773411130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6