ortals, experience the village's beauty before the tragedy, hear villagers' conversations, and communicate with Mora.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After her brother disappears near a cursed violet lake, Mora sets out to find him. As the lake's water rises, threatening the village, your help is crucial. Share clues you find in the underwater world, guide Mora in the past, and accompany her on a\u00a0time-bending journey that could decide the flood's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/9a96fa971cc9d9e46041c4b6fa8670f9.webp?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=39 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ad453cec618019cba35477d92447def4.poster.avif?t=1773411130\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/ad453cec618019cba35477d92447def4.webm?t=1773411130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can smoothly navigate the sunken landscape and enjoy lots of intriguing interactions with the environment. Play on PC with keyboard, mouse, or controller - or opt for a breathtaking immersive VR experience with natural arm-based swimming via motion tracking. Switch seamlessly between modes anytime, giving you complete freedom to choose how you explore the underwater world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129050/extras/a1260be45e54af48b249fa0b98bdb672.poster.avif?t=17734